 to combat them. In their specialized mecha called Round Bucklers, they must make the seas of Mars safe for humanity. Caught in the wrong place at the wrong time, Gram finds himself on the run with the most notorious pirates on Mars. But here's the thing—he's starting to like them!\n\n(Source: Bandai Entertainment)"},"tags":[{"name":"Pirates","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Mars Daybreak","english":"Mars Daybreak","native":"絢爛舞踏祭ザ･マーズ･デイブレイク","romaji":"Kenran Butou Sai: The Mars Daybreak","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"絢爛舞踏祭 ザ・マーズ・デイブレイク"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"绚烂舞踏祭"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}